exports[`Data Quality page: unchanged by the shared score bar and table > a finished job: score bar, filter panel, tabs and table > above 70 only 1`] = `"<div><div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><h1 class="page-title">Data <span class="text-gradient">Quality</span></h1><p class="page-subtitle">Check a contact file before you use it. Rows stay here until you approve them — nothing is added to your contacts, called or sent.</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap gap-2"><input type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" class="hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary">Upload file</button></div></div><p class="mb-3 text-xs text-slate-550">AI score: qwen2.5:3b on this server's Ollama. Only the name and business name are sent to it; phone numbers and emails are never sent.</p><p class="mb-4 text-xs text-slate-550">Columns are found by their header: Name, Phone (or Mobile), Business name (or Company), Email. Do not call, Not interested and Wrong person numbers are excluded and never scored. Placeholder numbers (9999999999, 1234567890, 9000000001) are invalid; Indian landlines are kept but lose 20 points (no WhatsApp). Placeholder emails (test@…, noemail@…, …@example.com) count as bad emails.</p><div class="-mx-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border-y border-line/70 bg-surface shadow-card sm:mx-0 sm:rounded-xl sm:border-x"><table class="table-soft w-full min-w-[44rem] text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-line text-left"><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">File</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Rows</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Valid</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Invalid</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Duplicate</th><th class="px-4 py