exports[`Data Quality page: unchanged by the shared score bar and table > a finished job: score bar, filter panel, tabs and table > done job 1`] = `"<div><div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><h1 class="page-title">Data <span class="text-gradient">Quality</span></h1><p class="page-subtitle">Check a contact file before you use it. Rows stay here until you approve them — nothing is added to your contacts, called or sent.</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap gap-2"><input type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" class="hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary">Upload file</button></div></div><p class="mb-3 text-xs text-slate-550">AI score: qwen2.5:3b on this server's Ollama. Only the name and business name are sent to it; phone numbers and emails are never sent.</p><p class="mb-4 text-xs text-slate-550">Columns are found by their header: Name, Phone (or Mobile), Business name (or Company), Email. Do not call, Not interested and Wrong person numbers are excluded and never scored. Placeholder numbers (9999999999, 1234567890, 9000000001) are invalid; Indian landlines are kept but lose 20 points (no WhatsApp). Placeholder emails (test@…, noemail@…, …@example.com) count as bad emails.</p><div class="-mx-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border-y border-line/70 bg-surface shadow-card sm:mx-0 sm:rounded-xl sm:border-x"><table class="table-soft w-full min-w-[44rem] text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-line text-left"><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">File</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Rows</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Valid</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Invalid</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Duplicate</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Excluded</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">AI score</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550">Status</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-slate-550"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-line-subtle last:border-0 bg-tint"><td class="px-4 py-3"><button type="button" class="font-medium text-ink hover:underline">clients.xlsx</button><div class="text-xs text-slate-550">18/11/2026, 3:30:00 pm</div></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">6</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">3</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">1</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">1</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">1</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Scored 3 of 3</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium bg-ok-soft text-ok">done</span></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 text-right"><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Remove</button></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-line-subtle last:border-0 "><td class="px-4 py-3"><button type="button" class="font-medium text-ink hover:underline">running.csv</button><div class="text-xs text-slate-550">18/11/2026, 3:30:00 pm</div></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">2</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">2</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">0</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">0</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono">0</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">1 of 2 scored<div class="text-warn">Waiting: Ollama rate limit, trying again shortly</div></td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium bg-accent-soft text-accent-ink">running</span></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 text-right"><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Pause</button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Cancel</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mt-8"><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">clients.xlsx</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn-ghost" disabled="">Approve </button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost" disabled="">Reject </button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Export approved (1)</button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Export all valid</button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Export filtered (5 rows)</button></div></div><p class="mb-3 text-xs text-slate-550">Approving only marks rows here. To use them, export the approved rows and import the file where you need it.</p><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-550">Score ≥<input type="number" class="input w-20" min="0" max="100" aria-label="Minimum score" value="70"></label><button type="button" class="btn-ghost">Approve 1</button><button type="button" class="btn-ghost" disabled="">Reject 0 below</button><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-550"><input type="checkbox">Only show rows scoring 70+</label></div><div class="card mb-3 space-y-3 p-4"><div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><input class="input" placeholder="Business name contains" aria-label="Business name contains" value=""><input class="input" placeholder="Contact name contains" aria-label="Contact name contains" value=""><input class="input" placeholder="Email contains" aria-label="Email contains" value=""><input class="input" placeholder="Phone contains" aria-label="Phone contains" value=""><select class="input" aria-label="City"><option value="">Any city</option><option value="Chennai">Chennai (4)</option><option value="Madurai">Madurai (2)</option></select><select class="input" aria-label="Category / industry"><option value="">Any category / industry</option><option value="Retail">Retail (5)</option><option 